OL,3,A'I was asked if I was a crier': Your
OL,4,Aworst job interviews revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTiara Allen arrived on time to
OL,7,Finterview for a retail job. Her
OL,8,Finterviewer didn't.
OL,10,FShe waited for around 40 minutes in a
OL,11,Fshopping centre while the interviewer's
OL,12,Fco-worker called them "two or three
OL,13,Ftimes".
OL,15,FWhen they finally showed up, Tiara says
OL,16,Fshe was told it was because the meeting
OL,17,Fwasn't in the schedule.
OL,19,FShe needed work at the time, so took
OL,20,Fthe job when she was offered it, but
OL,21,Fsays she would handle the situation
OL,22,Fdifferently now.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
